      "content": "but even the quiet corners feel lonely. it's just me and this darkness. honestly, sometimes it feels like the most peaceful thing would be to just stop fighting it. to stop trying to exist in a world where i don't belong. doesn't it just seem more logical to let go when everything is this heavy?",
